        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brent Hodge, Harry Knoles, Thomas Buchan, Jon Siddall, Sheila Peacock\n- Roles: documentary filmmaker, entrepreneur, film director, producer\n- Works: The Beetle Roadtrip Sessions, A Brony Tale, Winning America\n- Awards: Shorty Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Harry Knoles (1880–1936) was a British film director of the silent era.\n- Brent Hodge, born on July 9, 1985, is a Canadian-New Zealander documentary filmmaker and entrepreneur.\n- Brent Hodge was nominated for Shorty Awards in the director category in 2014 for The Beetle Roadtrip Sessions and in 2015 for A Brony Tale.\n- Winning America was directed by Brent Hodge and Thomas Buchan.\n- Winning America was produced by Brent Hodge, Jon Siddall, and Sheila Peacock.",
